Package: SimpleUserAuthDropboxApp
Title: A Shiny App with partial user access control and dropbox connectivity
Version: 0.0.0.9000
Authors@R: 
    person("Jan", "Lisec", , "jan.lisec@bam.de", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: This Shiny App is set up as a Golem based R package and provides 
    an open and a restricted tab as well as dropbox connectivity. It is a 
    template that you can modify according to your needs.
